      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْوَلُ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشَدُّ</span> [<i>More,</i> and <i>most, hard to be
